  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-09-13T14:48:19-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, September 13, 2018, 2:48 pm\">September 13, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<p><img class=\"size-medium wp-image-3983 alignright\" src=\"/media/archive/c456b8ba84388c3042d6728448311ec28ec76f55aee7cb1b6e729f9affcfad33.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"186\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" />The public is cordially invited to meet Paul Durr Hammersten during his Meet The Artist event at the Gallery of the Guild of Harwich Artists Saturday, September 29 from 10:00 AM to 5:00 PM. Paul will be unveiling his latest masterwork, an acrylic rendering on hand carved and tooled leather, titled A BLAZE OF GLORY.</p>\n<p><a title=\"Original source page returned 404\" href>The Art Gallery</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (source page unavailable)</span> is located at <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/551+Main+Street+(Rte.+28)+in+Harwich+Port,/@41.6679104,-70.0748383,3a,75y,137.67h,84.1t/data=!3m6!1e1!3m4!1scA0f0CO4V0T0cK4MXp8psw!2e0!7i13312!8i6656!4m2!3m1!1s0x89fb3e40a1e5db59:0xdecde7dbf5846696\">551 Main Street (Rte. 28) in Harwich Port,</a> <a href=\"tel:(508)%20432-1012\">(508) 432-1012</a>. Free parking across the street at the Harwich Chamber of Commerce Visitors Information Center.</p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-a2dd2a8b0cc8efdccc38/\" rel=\"tag\">MEET THE ARTIST</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-3b7a7197884c65093e45/\" rel=\"tag\">THE ART GALLERY</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-bc2e4bef39a39f9eb9e9/\" rel=\"tag\">THE ART GALLERY ARTISTS</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
